  "2026-07-25T00:15:36.128Z",codex-root,"Duplicate check: searched all statuses for brace-expansion, GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg, Dependabot, and unbounded expansion. Closed pm-f5hy2n tracks a different earlier advisory GHSA-3jxr-9vmj-r5cp. This newly disclosed GHSA has a distinct identifier, vulnerable range, and patched version."
  "2026-07-25T02:02:09.342Z","harness:codex","Evidence: removed the obsolete TOON decode compatibility rewrite after upgrading to @toon-format/toon 2.3.1. Focused decode regression coverage and the complete 6,290-test suite pass at 100% for statements, branches, functions, and lines."
  "2026-07-25T02:02:47.605Z","harness:codex","Correction to the immediately preceding evidence comment: this item owns the brace-expansion advisory, not TOON decoding. Evidence: the lockfile and workspace override require brace-expansion >=5.0.8, pnpm audit --audit-level high reports no known vulnerabilities, and the complete quality suite passes."
